<title>USA: CBOE seat sells for record $630,000.</title>
<headline>CBOE seat sells for record $630,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A seat at the Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) sold for $630,000 on Monday, a record price, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Another seat also sold Monday for $615,000.</p>
<p>The prior record was $565,000 set on February 13.</p>
<p>The current bid/offer for seats was $620,000/$650,000.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
</text>
